<p>Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}}&nbsp;</p>

<p>How has your first couple weeks as an agent been?</p>

<p>I know a lot of agency owners want their staff to practice quoting on aged date and friends and family throughout the first couple of weeks before throwing them some good stuff!</p>

<p>With that being said I figured I would reach out to see if you wanted to schedule time for us to review my leads/calls program?</p>

<p>Normally our retail levels range from $13-$23 per lead, however my specialist has the ability to price you anywhere between $3-$12 per lead, so would love just a few minutes of your time to go over your plan!&nbsp;</p>

